### Test API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test

### Get All Projects
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects

### Create New Project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My First Project",
    "description": "This is my first project created with REST Client!",
    "imageUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/400x300",
    "liveUrl": "https://myproject.com",
    "githubUrl": "https://github.com/myproject",
    "technologies": ["React", "Node.js", "MongoDB"],
    "featured": true
}

### Create Another Project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "E-Commerce Website",
    "description": "A full-featured online store with payment integration",
    "imageUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/FF6B6B/FFFFFF",
    "liveUrl": "https://myecommerce.com",
    "githubUrl": "https://github.com/myecommerce",
    "technologies": ["React", "Redux", "Node.js", "Stripe"],
    "featured": true
}

### Create Third Project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Weather App",
    "description": "Real-time weather application with 5-day forecast",
    "imageUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/4ECDC4/FFFFFF",
    "liveUrl": "https://myweatherapp.com",
    "githubUrl": "https://github.com/myweatherapp",
    "technologies": ["React", "Axios", "Weather API"],
    "featured": false
}

### Get Single Project (Replace {id} with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/{id}

### Update Project (Replace {id} with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/projects/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Project Title",
    "featured": true
}

### Delete Project (Replace {id} with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/projects/{id}